<script type="application/ld+json">{"@context":"https:\/\/schema.org","@type":"BreadcrumbList","itemListElement":[{"@type":"ListItem","position":1,"item":{"@type":"Thing","@id":"https:\/\/www.yozgatmedya.com.tr","name":"Haberler"}},{"@type":"ListItem","position":2,"item":{"@type":"Thing","@id":"https:\/\/www.yozgatmedya.com.tr\/politika","name":"Politika"}},{"@type":"ListItem","position":3,"item":{"@type":"Thing","@id":"https:\/\/www.yozgatmedya.com.tr\/yozgatta-yeni-parti-on-seciminin-galibi-yasar","name":"Yozgat'ta YEN\u0130 Parti \u00d6n Se\u00e7iminin Galibi Ya\u015far"}}]}</script>
<script type="application/ld+json">{"@context":"https:\/\/schema.org","@type":"NewsArticle","headline":"Yozgat'ta YEN\u0130 Parti \u00d6n Se\u00e7iminin Galibi Ya\u015far","articleSection":"Politika","dateCreated":"2026-10-19T13:06:00+03:00","datePublished":"2026-10-19T13:06:00+03:00","dateModified":"2026-10-19T13:16:44+03:00","wordCount":428,"genre":"news","mainEntityOfPage":{"@type":"WebPage","@id":"https:\/\/www.yozgatmedya.com.tr\/yozgatta-yeni-parti-on-seciminin-galibi-yasar"},"articleBody":"YEN\u0130 Parti Yozgat \u0130l Ba\u015fkanl\u0131\u011f\u0131 i\u00e7in ger\u00e7ekle\u015ftirilen \u00f6n se\u00e7imde heyecan sona erdi. Kurucu \u0130l Ba\u015fkan\u0131 Abdullah Ya\u015far ile Berkay Apsalm\u0131\u015f\u2019\u0131n yar\u0131\u015ft\u0131\u011f\u0131 se\u00e7imde, \u00fcyelerin tercihi Abdullah Ya\u015far\u2019dan yana oldu.\r\n\r\nToplam 2 bin 912 \u00fcyenin oy kullanma hakk\u0131na sahip oldu\u011fu se\u00e7imde, Abdullah Ya\u015far 1541 oy al\u0131rken rakibi Berkay Apsalm\u0131\u015f ise 461 oy ald\u0131.\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\nDelegeler sand\u0131k ba\u015f\u0131na gitti\r\n\r\nYozgat'ta ger\u00e7ekle\u015ftirilen \u00f6n se\u00e7imde iki aday kar\u015f\u0131 kar\u015f\u0131ya geldi. Kurucu \u0130l Ba\u015fkan\u0131 Abdullah Ya\u015far ile gen\u00e7 aday Berkay Apsalm\u0131\u015f'\u0131n yar\u0131\u015ft\u0131\u011f\u0131 se\u00e7imde delegeler oylar\u0131n\u0131 kulland\u0131. Yap\u0131lan oylaman\u0131n ard\u0131ndan Ya\u015far'\u0131n se\u00e7imi kazand\u0131\u011f\u0131 bildirildi. B\u00f6ylece YEN\u0130 Parti'nin Yozgat te\u015fkilat\u0131nda il ba\u015fkanl\u0131\u011f\u0131 i\u00e7in ilk b\u00fcy\u00fck s\u0131nav tamamlanm\u0131\u015f oldu.\r\n\r\nDeneyim ile gen\u00e7 aday yar\u0131\u015ft\u0131\r\n\r\nYar\u0131\u015f, siyasetin tan\u0131d\u0131k bir ismini gen\u00e7 bir adayla kar\u015f\u0131 kar\u015f\u0131ya getirmesiyle dikkat \u00e7ekti. Yozgat siyasetini yak\u0131ndan izleyenler i\u00e7in se\u00e7im, yeni kurulan partinin il \u00f6rg\u00fct\u00fcn\u00fcn nas\u0131l \u015fekillenece\u011fi konusunda da ilk i\u015faret niteli\u011fi ta\u015f\u0131d\u0131. Delegelerin tercihi, mevcut kurucu il ba\u015fkan\u0131ndan yana oldu.\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\nYa\u015far'\u0131n YEN\u0130 Parti yolculu\u011fu\r\n\r\nAbdullah Ya\u015far, daha \u00f6nce CHP Yozgat \u0130l Ba\u015fkanl\u0131\u011f\u0131 g\u00f6revini y\u00fcr\u00fct\u00fcyordu. Butlan karar\u0131n\u0131n ard\u0131ndan CHP Genel Ba\u015fkanl\u0131\u011f\u0131'na getirilen Kemal K\u0131l\u0131\u00e7daro\u011flu'nun MYK karar\u0131yla g\u00f6revden al\u0131nm\u0131\u015ft\u0131. Ya\u015far, g\u00f6revden al\u0131nmas\u0131n\u0131n ard\u0131ndan il\u00e7e \u00f6rg\u00fct\u00fc ba\u015fkanlar\u0131 ve y\u00f6neticileriyle birlikte CHP'den istifa ettiklerini a\u00e7\u0131klad\u0131. Grup, Bo\u011fazl\u0131yan'da toplanarak YEN\u0130 Parti il\u00e7e \u00f6rg\u00fct\u00fc binas\u0131na y\u00fcr\u00fcd\u00fc. Ya\u015far o g\u00fcn yapt\u0131\u011f\u0131 konu\u015fmada, m\u00fccadelelerini \u00d6zg\u00fcr \u00d6zel liderli\u011findeki YEN\u0130 Parti \u00e7at\u0131s\u0131 alt\u0131nda s\u00fcrd\u00fcreceklerini s\u00f6ylemi\u015fti.\r\n\r\nYozgat'taki bu ge\u00e7i\u015f, CHP'den YEN\u0130 Parti'ye y\u00f6nelen ve bir\u00e7ok ilde g\u00f6r\u00fclen toplu istifa dalgas\u0131n\u0131n bir par\u00e7as\u0131 olarak izlendi.\r\n\r\nS\u0131rada ne var?\r\n\r\n\u00d6n se\u00e7imin ard\u0131ndan Yozgat'ta s\u00fcrecin nas\u0131l ilerleyece\u011fi, kongre takviminin ne zaman netle\u015fece\u011fi ve il ba\u015fkanl\u0131\u011f\u0131 g\u00f6revinin resmen hangi a\u015famada kesinle\u015fece\u011fi merak konusu.\r\n\r\nYozgat'ta partililer, se\u00e7imin ard\u0131ndan yeni d\u00f6nemde \u00f6rg\u00fct \u00e7al\u0131\u015fmalar\u0131n\u0131n h\u0131z kazanmas\u0131n\u0131 bekliyor. G\u00f6zler \u015fimdi Ya\u015far'\u0131n ataca\u011f\u0131 ad\u0131mlara, y\u00f6netim kadrosunu nas\u0131l olu\u015fturaca\u011f\u0131na ve il\u00e7e te\u015fkilatlar\u0131yla kuraca\u011f\u0131 ileti\u015fime \u00e7evrildi.","description":"YEN\u0130 Parti Yozgat \u0130l Ba\u015fkanl\u0131\u011f\u0131 \u00f6n se\u00e7iminde sand\u0131ktan Abdullah Ya\u015far \u00e7\u0131kt\u0131. Delegelerin oy kulland\u0131\u011f\u0131 yar\u0131\u015fta kurucu \u0130l Ba\u015fkan\u0131 Ya\u015far, gen\u00e7 aday Berkay\u2026","inLanguage":"tr-TR","keywords":[],"image":{"@type":"ImageObject","url":"https:\/\/yozgatmedyacomtr.teimg.com\/crop\/1280x720\/yozgatmedya-com-tr\/uploads\/2026\/08\/abdullah-yasar-3.jpg","width":"1280","height":"720","caption":"Yozgat'ta YEN\u0130 Parti \u00d6n Se\u00e7iminin Galibi Ya\u015far"},"isFamilyFriendly":"http:\/\/schema.org\/True","isAccessibleForFree":"http:\/\/schema.org\/True","publisher":{"@type":"NewsMediaOrganization","@id":"https:\/\/www.yozgatmedya.com.tr\/#organization","name":"https:\/\/news.google.com\/publications\/CAAqBwgKMMCovwswzcPWAw","image":"https:\/\/yozgatmedyacomtr.teimg.com\/yozgatmedya-com-tr\/uploads\/2026\/05\/yozgatmedya-logo-1.png","logo":{"@type":"ImageObject","url":"https:\/\/yozgatmedyacomtr.teimg.com\/yozgatmedya-com-tr\/uploads\/2026\/05\/yozgatmedya-logo-1.png","width":"640","height":"375"}},"author":{"@type":"Person","name":"Yozgat Medya","url":"https:\/\/www.yozgatmedya.com.tr\/muhabir\/6\/yozgat-medya"},"editor":{"@type":"Person","name":"Yozgat Medya","url":"https:\/\/www.yozgatmedya.com.tr\/muhabir\/6\/yozgat-medya"},"creator":{"@type":"NewsMediaOrganization","@id":"https:\/\/www.yozgatmedya.com.tr\/#organization","name":"https:\/\/news.google.com\/publications\/CAAqBwgKMMCovwswzcPWAw","url":"https:\/\/www.yozgatmedya.com.tr"}}</script>


